    "close": "the first policy step whose executed gripper command is > 0 after a command <= 0 (the gripper starts open)",
    "close_is_on": "the object or fixture owning the geom whose centre is nearest the gripper site at the frame after that step; every geom of every body of the entity counts",
    "close_max_distance_m": null,
    "contact": "the first policy step with a gripper geom in contact with a geom of an object or fixture",
